 hero2lte board

---
 .../boot/dts/exynos/exynos8890-hero2lte.dts   |  588 ++++++++++
 .../boot/dts/exynos/exynos8890-pinctrl.dtsi   |  703 ++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8890.dtsi    | 1009 +++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 2300 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8890-hero2lte.dts
